---
import { MARK_PATH } from '../data/mark.ts';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

---
  <div class="hero">
    <header class="intro">
      <div class="intro-top">
        <img class="portrait" src={`${base}/assets/joao-victor.jpg`} width="96" height="96" alt="João Victor Meneghel" />
        <div class="intro-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 307.244 176.752" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path pathLength="1" d={MARK_PATH}/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language / Idioma">
          <button type="button" data-set-lang="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button>
          <button type="button" data-set-lang="pt" aria-pressed="false">PT</button>
          <button type="button" data-set-lang="es" aria-pressed="false">ES</button>
          <button type="button" data-set-lang="fr" aria-pressed="false">FR</button>
          <button type="button" data-set-lang="zh" aria-pressed="false" lang="zh-Hans">中文</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1>João Victor Meneghel</h1>
      <p class="lede"><span data-l="en">I'm the bridge between raw data and creativity. I'm based in Espírito Santo, Brazil, and I'm open to remote and&nbsp;international roles.</span><span data-l="fr">Je suis le pont entre la donnée brute et la créativité. Je vis dans l’Espírito Santo, au Brésil, et je suis ouvert à des opportunités à distance et&nbsp;internationales.</span><span data-l="pt">Sou a ponte entre o dado bruto e a criatividade. Moro no Espírito Santo e estou aberto a oportunidades remotas e&nbsp;internacionais.</span><span data-l="es">Soy el puente entre el dato bruto y la creatividad. Vivo en Espírito Santo, Brasil, y estoy abierto a oportunidades remotas e&nbsp;internacionales.</span><span data-l="zh">我是原始数据与创意之间的桥梁。我住在巴西圣埃斯皮里图州（Espírito Santo），欢迎远程及国际合作机会。</span></p>
      <p><span data-l="en">At the Anchieta city government I manage the official channels (the Instagram has passed 23 million views since Aug 2025), inspect public contracts and built the citizen service chatbot. Before that, I ran the digital side of the campaign that won a mayoral race in Alfredo Chaves with 58% in the first round, after five straight losses in the same city.</span><span data-l="fr">À la mairie d’Anchieta, je gère les canaux officiels (l’Instagram a dépassé 23 millions de vues depuis août 2025), j’inspecte les contrats publics et j’ai construit le chatbot de service aux citoyens. Avant cela, j’ai dirigé le volet numérique de la campagne qui a remporté la mairie d’Alfredo Chaves avec 58 % au premier tour, après cinq défaites consécutives dans la même ville.</span><span data-l="pt">Na Prefeitura de Anchieta, cuido dos canais oficiais (o Instagram passou de 23 milhões de visualizações desde ago/2025), fiscalizo contratos públicos e coloquei no ar o chatbot de atendimento ao cidadão. Antes disso, cuidei do digital da campanha que elegeu o prefeito de Alfredo Chaves com 58% no primeiro turno, depois de cinco derrotas seguidas na cidade.</span><span data-l="es">En la Alcaldía de Anchieta gestiono los canales oficiales (el Instagram superó los 23 millones de visualizaciones desde agosto de 2025), superviso contratos públicos y puse en funcionamiento el chatbot de atención al ciudadano. Antes de eso, estuve a cargo del frente digital de la campaña que eligió al alcalde de Alfredo Chaves con el 58% en la primera vuelta, tras cinco derrotas seguidas en la ciudad.</span><span data-l="zh">在 Anchieta 市政府，我负责管理官方渠道（其 Instagram 自 2025 年 8 月以来浏览量超过 2300 万次）、监督公共合同，并上线了市民服务聊天机器人。此前，我负责了 Alfredo Chaves 市长竞选的数字传播工作：候选人在第一轮以 58% 的得票率当选，而该市此前已连续五次落败。</span></p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn primary resume-default" href={`${base}/assets/joao-victor-meneghel-resume.pdf`} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 9h-4V3H9v6H5l7 7 7-7zM5 18v2h14v-2H5z"/></svg><span data-l="en">Download resume</span><span data-l="fr">Télécharger le CV</span><span data-l="pt">Baixar currículo</span><span data-l="es">Descargar currículum</span><span data-l="zh">下载简历</span></a>
        <a class="btn primary resume-fr" lang="fr" href={`${base}/assets/joao-victor-meneghel-cv-fr.pdf`} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 9h-4V3H9v6H5l7 7 7-7zM5 18v2h14v-2H5z"/></svg>Télécharger le CV</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:joaovictorpmeneghel@gmail.com"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/></svg><span data-l="en">Email</span><span data-l="fr">E-mail</span><span data-l="pt">E-mail</span><span data-l="es">Correo</span><span data-l="zh">电子邮件</span></a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://linkedin.com/in/joaovictormeneghel" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>LinkedIn</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/menegheljv" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>GitHub</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="stats">
        <li><b>23M+</b><span class="desc"><span data-l="en">views on the Anchieta City Hall Instagram (since Aug 2025)</span><span data-l="fr">vues sur l’Instagram de la mairie d’Anchieta (depuis août 2025)</span><span data-l="pt">visualizações no Instagram da Prefeitura de Anchieta (desde ago/2025)</span><span data-l="es">visualizaciones en el Instagram de la Alcaldía de Anchieta (desde agosto de 2025)</span><span data-l="zh">Anchieta 市政府 Instagram 的浏览量（2025 年 8 月起）</span></span></li>
        <li><b>58%</b><span class="desc"><span data-l="en">first-round win, after five straight losses</span><span data-l="fr">victoire au premier tour, après cinq défaites consécutives</span><span data-l="pt">vitória no 1º turno, depois de cinco derrotas seguidas</span><span data-l="es">victoria en primera vuelta, tras cinco derrotas seguidas</span><span data-l="zh">第一轮胜选，此前连续五次落败</span></span></li>
        <li><b>180K+</b><span class="desc"><span data-l="en">reach with zero paid media, beach-litter&nbsp;campaign</span><span data-l="fr">de portée sans média payant, campagne contre les déchets sur la&nbsp;plage</span><span data-l="pt">de alcance sem mídia paga, campanha sobre o lixo na&nbsp;praia</span><span data-l="es">de alcance sin pauta paga, campaña sobre la basura en la&nbsp;playa</span><span data-l="zh">零付费投放的触达量，海滩垃圾主题活动</span></span></li>
        <li><b>2.4M+</b><span class="desc"><span data-l="en">organic views on the mayor's Instagram (Aug to Dec 2025)</span><span data-l="fr">vues organiques sur l’Instagram du maire (août à déc. 2025)</span><span data-l="pt">visualizações orgânicas no Instagram do prefeito (ago a dez/2025)</span><span data-l="es">visualizaciones orgánicas en el Instagram del alcalde (ago a dic de 2025)</span><span data-l="zh">市长 Instagram 的自然浏览量（2025 年 8 月至 12 月）</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </header>
  </div>
  <div class="jump-bar">
    <nav class="jump" aria-label="Sections">
      <a href="#work"><span data-l="en">Work</span><span data-l="fr">Projets</span><span data-l="pt">Projetos</span><span data-l="es">Proyectos</span><span data-l="zh">项目</span></a>
      <a href="#experience"><span data-l="en">Experience</span><span data-l="fr">Expérience</span><span data-l="pt">Experiência</span><span data-l="es">Experiencia</span><span data-l="zh">经历</span></a>
      <a href="#recognition"><span data-l="en">Recognition</span><span data-l="fr">Reconnaissance</span><span data-l="pt">Reconhecimento</span><span data-l="es">Reconocimientos</span><span data-l="zh">荣誉</span></a>
      <a href="#education"><span data-l="en">Education</span><span data-l="fr">Formation</span><span data-l="pt">Formação</span><span data-l="es">Formación</span><span data-l="zh">学历</span></a>
      <a href="#skills"><span data-l="en">Skills</span><span data-l="fr">Compétences</span><span data-l="pt">Habilidades</span><span data-l="es">Habilidades</span><span data-l="zh">技能</span></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
